{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31918","headline":"寄令狐綯相公 · 贾岛","name":"寄令狐綯相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驴骏胜羸马，东川路匪赊。\n一缄论贾谊，三蜀寄严家。\n澄彻霜江水，分明露石沙。\n话言声及政，栈阁谷离斜。\n自着衣偏暖，谁忧雪六花。\n裹裳留阔襆，防患与通茶。\n山馆中宵起，星河残月华。\n双僮前日雇，数口向天涯。\n良乐知骐骥，张雷验镆鋣。\n谦光贤将相，别纸圣龙蛇。\n岂有斯言玷，应无白璧瑕。\n不妨圆魄里，人亦指虾蟇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}